        <activityName xml:lang="en">Plate heat exchanger</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Plate heat exchanger
This data set describes the production of the a plate heat exchanger from literature source. Electricity use data stems from company figures, requirements from working materials from literature. Transport distances are estimated.;
UUID: 710d9769-8ac7-3520-a86e-e98c8f14ee72
This data set describes the production of the a plate heat exchanger including energy use, use of semi-finished products and working materials, waste treatment and transports of components.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: High alloyed steel plate heat exchanger
Time period: The literature source from 1999 uses company specific of year 1999 for the energy use, and data from 1996 for the working materials.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: production requirements are calculated per kg product
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_710d9769-8ac7-3520-a86e-e98c8f14ee72.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
